{"seq":6,"slug":"ecommerce-data-analytics","title":"电商数据分析","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":3,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics","rating":{"composite":3.46,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.44,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 电商数据分析 简介\n\n数据分析是电商业务从经验驱动走向科学决策的关键能力。在电商场景中，从流量来源到转化漏斗，从用户行为到财务健康，每一个业务环节都产生着大量可量化的数据。能否有效地度量、分析并利用这些数据，直接决定了运营效率与增长质量。本模块系统讲解电商数据分析的核心方法论与技术实践。\n\n本模块适用于电商数据分析师、运营负责人、产品经理以及希望建立数据思维的技术人员。读者应具备基本的数据分析概念，如指标、维度、漏斗等，但无需深厚的统计学背景。\n\n第一章**指标体系与 KPI**从顶层设计出发，讲解电商指标框架的构建方法、转化漏斗分析、客户终身价值计算以及财务指标体系，帮助读者建立结构化的数据度量思维。\n\n第二章**用户行为分析**深入探讨用户旅程分析、群组分析、RFM 客户分层以及归因模型，揭示用户行为背后的规律与驱动因素。\n\n第三章**数据基础设施**聚焦数据仓库设计、实时分析架构、BI 仪表盘搭建以及数据驱动决策的落地方法，为数据分析提供坚实的技术底座。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章建立指标体系的全局框架，明确\"该看什么数据\"；再通过第二章掌握用户行为分析方法，理解\"数据背后的含义\"；最后通过第三章构建数据基础设施，解决\"如何高效获取和展示数据\"。三章形成了从指标定义到分析方法再到技术落地的完整闭环。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"metrics-and-kpi","title":"指标体系与 KPI","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/metrics-and-kpi","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ecommerce-metrics-framework","title":"电商指标体系全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/metrics-and-kpi/ecommerce-metrics-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"conversion-funnel-analysis","title":"转化漏斗分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/metrics-and-kpi/conversion-funnel-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"customer-ltv-analysis","title":"客户生命周期价值分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/metrics-and-kpi/customer-ltv-analysis"},{"seq":4,"slug":"financial-metrics","title":"财务指标与盈利分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/metrics-and-kpi/financial-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-behavior-analytics","title":"用户行为分析","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/user-behavior-analytics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"user-journey-analytics","title":"用户旅程与行为追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/user-behavior-analytics/user-journey-analytics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cohort-analysis","title":"群组分析与留存建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/user-behavior-analytics/cohort-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rfm-segmentation","title":"RFM 分层与用户画像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/user-behavior-analytics/rfm-segmentation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"attribution-modeling","title":"归因模型与渠道评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/user-behavior-analytics/attribution-modeling"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-infrastructure","title":"数据基础设施","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/data-infrastructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-warehouse-design","title":"电商数据仓库设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/data-infrastructure/data-warehouse-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"real-time-analytics","title":"实时分析与流处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/data-infrastructure/real-time-analytics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bi-dashboard-design","title":"BI 看板设计与数据可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/data-infrastructure/bi-dashboard-design"},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-driven-decision","title":"数据驱动决策体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-data-analytics/data-infrastructure/data-driven-decision"}]}]}